        "body": "Each cut takes away 1 head and adds 3, so the dragon gains 2 heads.\n\nFirst cut: $3 - 1 + 3 = 5$ heads. Second cut: $5 - 1 + 3 = 7$ heads.\n\n**Answer: (B) 7**"
